      "name": "Dithubaruba Cultural Festival",
      "writeup": "An annual event celebrating Tswana culture through traditional music, dance, and storytelling.",
      "wiki": {
        "extract": "The Dithubaruba Cultural Festival is one of the national events celebrated in Botswana and is also marked in the Botswana Calendar of Events. It aims to promote Kweneng cultural heritage and create leisure time for the community.",
